limitations of "Singly Linked List"

1. Get --> 0(n) time complexity
2. if only head is given
3. More space is used
4. we can't move  backward this is the biggest limitation


Doubly LinkedList
solve the biggest limitation

 class Node {
   int val;
   Node next;
   Node prev;
 }


can we create a doubly linked list using one pointer with every node ?
yes possible

by storing XOR of addresses of previous and next nodes!


## Circular linked list
1) Singly
2) Doubly

